T[#T+1]={id=18959,class="Script",parent=18915,props={["AttributesSerialize"]="",["Disabled"]=true,["LinkedSource"]="",["Name"]="CHANGE LOG",["ScriptGuid"]="{9B442DC5-C98D-4136-AEB5-094DD847D462}",["Source"]="--[[\010\009\010v1.0.6\010==================================================\010-Fixed a glitch which player can shooting even after died\010-Added \034ChargedShot\034 setting\010-Added \034Minigun\034 setting\010-Added \034Piercing\034 setting\010-Added \034FadeTime\034 setting\010-Updated \034BulletVisualizerScript\034. Replace an older one now!\010==================================================\010\009\010v1.0.5\010==================================================\010-Fixed a gun that shoot slower even you set \034FireRate\034 to lower\010-Added \034ShotgunReload\034 setting\010==================================================\010\009\010v1.0.4\010==================================================\010-Fixed VisualizeBulletScript and BulletVisualizerScript. Previously, it's a bug that doesn't show bullet for other player.\010-Fixed a bug which scope still in use even unequipped\010==================================================\010\009\010v1.0.3\010==================================================\010-Fixed a bug that you can reload a gun even unequip\010-Ray start position is now at Player's Head instead Gun Muzzle\010-Added \034DualEnabled\034 setting\010-Added Ammo Box for the gun\010-User can no longer use Scope while reloading\010==================================================\010\009\010v1.0.2\010==================================================\010-Fixed Bullet Visualizer that doesn't display fake bullet to other player\010-Fixed fake bullet still displayed even \034VisualizerEnabled\034 is disabled\010==================================================\010\009\010v1.0.1\010==================================================\010-Fixed reload\010-Ammo GUI will not show if AmmoPerClip is \034math.huge\034\010-Added Animation setting\010========